    "title": "History Happened Here event | Cape Gazette",
    "text": "Share:\nHistory Happened Here event\nHistory Happened Here event, 10 a.m., Cape Henlopen State Park, Fort Miles Museum, Lewes. Join historical interpreters for presentations in celebration of nation’s 250th birthday, learn history of the Breakwater Quarantine Station which welcomed or warded off ships and sailors throughout the 1800s, free. Register by calling 302-644-5007.\nEvent Date:\nSat, 01/24/2026 - 10:00am",
